WEBVTT

00:04:28.378 --> 00:04:30.508
and steal your business from you.

00:04:30.508 --> 00:04:32.253
We have no control over these forces.

00:04:32.253 --> 00:04:33.770
These are a constant,

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:35.748
and they're not going away.

00:04:35.748 --> 00:04:37.794
The only variable are the conditions

00:04:37.794 --> 00:04:40.357
inside the organization,

00:04:40.357 --> 00:04:42.282
and that's where leadership matters,

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:44.961
because it's the leader that sets the tone.

00:04:44.961 --> 00:04:47.400
When a leader makes the choice

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.929
to put the safety and lives

00:04:48.929 --> 00:04:51.190
of the people inside the organization first,

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.068
to sacrifice their comforts and sacrifice

00:04:54.068 --> 00:04:57.573
the tangible results, so that the people remain

00:04:57.573 --> 00:04:59.000
and feel safe and feel like they belong,

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.894
remarkable things happen.